  "prefLabel": "Env-Dw 712.30 Recordkeeping and Reporting for PFAS Contaminants",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Dw 712.30 Recordkeeping and Reporting for PFAS Contaminants. An O/O shall:\n\n(a) Maintain records of PFAS contaminant analyses for not less than 10 years and as specified in Env-Dw 718; and\n\n(b) Report monitoring results for PFAS contaminants as specified in Env-Dw 719.\n\nSource. #12838, eff 9-30-19",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-dw700.html"
